# Files in the repository that are not part of the deployed site.
#
# Vercel serves the repository root, so anything left here is publicly
# fetchable. qa/ is verification evidence, apps-script/ is only the
# leads-sheet receiver, tools/ is local build and worker scripts, and the
# markdown is internal handover documentation.
qa/
apps-script/
tools/
assets/stories/*/masters/
assets/blog/*/masters/
*.md
.gitignore
